sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Usuario
    participant C as Cliente
    participant H as Handler
    participant S as Service
    participant R as Repository (sqlc)
    participant DB as Postgres

    U->>C: Click "Crear nota"
    U->>C: Escribe título + markdown
    U->>C: Click "Guardar"
    C->>H: POST /notes {title, content, tags}
    H->>H: validar JWT + body
    H->>S: Create(req, userID)
    S->>S: extractWikiLinks(content)
    S->>R: InsertNote(params)
    R->>DB: INSERT INTO notes ... RETURNING *
    DB-->>R: row
    R-->>S: Note
    S->>R: UpsertNoteLinks(sourceID, targets)
    R->>DB: INSERT ... ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING
    DB-->>R: ok
    R-->>S: ok
    S-->>H: Note
    H-->>C: 201 {note}
    C->>U: Toast "Nota creada" + navega a /note/[id]